     1 | template1  |     10 |        6 | c              | t             | t            | f              |           -1 |          734 |          1 |          1663 |             0 | C.UTF-8    | C.UTF-8  |           |             |                | {=c/runner,runner=CTc/runner}
     4 | template0  |     10 |        6 | c              | t             | f            | f              |           -1 |          734 |          1 |          1663 |             0 | C.UTF-8    | C.UTF-8  |           |             |                | {=c/runner,runner=CTc/runner}
